-# Rumpelstiltskin
+# Rumpelstiltskin
+
+**Rumpelstiltskin** is a Spring Boot microservice template using Maven.

+## Prerequisites
+- Java 17 JDK  
+- Maven 3.6+

+## Getting Started
+1. Clone the repo and switch to DEVELOPMENT:  
+   ```bash
+   git clone git@github.com:dougboyd/Rumpelstiltskin.git
+   git checkout DEVELOPMENT
+   ```
+2. Build:  
+   ```bash
+   mvn clean package
+   ```
+3. Run locally:  
+   ```bash
+   mvn spring-boot:run
+   ```
+   The app starts on port 8080.

+## Project Structure
+```
+Rumpelstiltskin/
+├─ src/
+│  ├─ main/java/au/com/dougboyd/rumpelstiltskin
+│  └─ main/resources/
+├─ pom.xml
+└─ README.md
+```

+## Branching Model
+- **DEVELOPMENT** (default): active feature work  
+- **TEST**: integration/QA  
+- **PRODUCTION**: stable releases  

+## Contributing
+1. Fork & clone  
+2. `git checkout -b feature/<name>`  
+3. `git commit -am "Add <feature>" && git push origin feature/<name>`  
+4. Open PR against **DEVELOPMENT**

